                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Appendix B—Paraphrase]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Draft</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Message to the London Munitions Assignments
                        Board</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Until the countries which are members of the European Advisory Commission have
                    agreed upon a disposal policy, and until such an agreed policy is implemented,
                    the London Munitions Assignments Board is authorized to assign surrendered or
                    captured enemy matériel in the hands of British-or American-commanded forces in
                    Austria and Germany to the forces of those countries which will use such
                    matériel in furtherance of the agreed strategy in the war against Japan.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
